            body: "- **Thursday 31 December 2026 — RENAISSANCE Tulum NYE.** Opens the season and the year: Sasha, Maceo Plex, Sébastien Léger and Ida Engberg, and the organiser says more headliners are yet to be revealed for New Year's Eve [nights.0.date] [nights.0.acts] [nights.0.more_tba] [sources.s10]. Announced on 2 October 2026. Renaissance has played Zamna Tulum for nearly a decade, by the organiser's account [nights.0.announcedOn] [nights.0.note]. Redeemable with the Multipass [nights.0.inMultipass]. [The night's page at the organiser](/go/zamna-tulum-renaissance/)\n- **Monday 4 January 2027 — ANYMA presents ÆDEN Tulum.** Anyma heads the night with the audiovisual show ÆDEN, joined by ZSS, Layla Benitez, Adam Sellouk, 19:26, CAMELPHAT, Cassian, VOLKODER, Vomee, Hardt Antoine and KAS:ST [nights.1.acts] [nights.1.support] [nights.1.note]. Announced on 9 September 2026 [nights.1.announcedOn]. Redeemable with the Multipass [nights.1.inMultipass]. [The night's page at the organiser](/go/zamna-tulum-anyma/)\n- **Wednesday 6 January 2027 — Black Coffee at Zamna Tulum.** Black Coffee [nights.2.acts]. The night has its page on the organiser's site, sits in its listing and is sold by both sellers. The organiser published no news item for it [nights.2.note] [sellers.tixr.sells] [not_found]. Redeemable with the Multipass [nights.2.inMultipass]. [The night's page at the organiser](/go/zamna-tulum-black-coffee/)\n- **Friday 8 January 2027 — Adriatique presents X Tulum.** Adriatique with WhoMadeWho, Mind Against, Kotiēr and Sama (US) [nights.3.acts]. Announced on 1 October 2026 as a show of its own, sold separately [nights.3.announcedOn] [nights.3.note]. Not redeemable with the Multipass [nights.3.inMultipass]. [The night's page at the organiser](/go/zamna-tulum-adriatique/)\n- **Sunday 10 January 2027 — Adam Port at Zamna Tulum.** Adam Port closes the season [nights.4.acts] [nights.4.note]. Announced on 18 September 2026 for 10 January, and the night's page and the listing give that date [nights.4.announcedOn] [nights.4.note]. Redeemable with the Multipass [nights.4.inMultipass]. [The night's page at the organiser](/go/zamna-tulum-adam-port/)",
